<title>USA: Robert Fleming names Urey senior sales trader.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming names Urey senior sales trader.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brian Urey has been hired as senior sales trader on Robert Fleming Inc's Latin American securities team, the firm said.</p>
<p>Robert Fleming said in a statement that Urey had been head of Latin American trading at LGT Management in San Francisco. He will be based in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
